+ * Regression test for GHSA-5j59-xgg2-r9c4 / CVE-2025-67779
+ * (follow-up to CVE-2025-55184).
+ *
+ * A crafted Server Function deserialization payload can create cyclic
+ * thenables that cause an infinite loop in Chunk.prototype.then inside the
+ * vendored React Server DOM bundles, leading to resource exhaustion / DoS.
+ *
